module-description = Posts a message that gets enough stars to a channel, and keeps its count up to date.
config-starboard-channel = The channel the posts go to. The starboard is off until one is chosen.
config-starboard-threshold = How many stars a message needs to be posted.
config-starboard-emoji = The emoji that counts: a regular emoji, or a custom one written <:name:id>.
config-starboard-self_star = Count the star of the author of the message too.
starboard-source = Source
starboard-reason = Nobody stars the message any more
